# Unsubtle Mockery deals exactly 4 damage to Bot2's Ancient Crab (1/5), which survives with 4 damage marked (not 3, not 5), and Bot1 still
# surveils 1 (the damage dealt does not have to kill): the Mountain on top of the library goes to the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Unsubtle Mockery
Black Lotus
Island x6
Mountain
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Ancient Crab
Black Lotus
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot2.Hand.Ancient Crab.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Unsubtle Mockery.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Ancient Crab)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange( | Mountain)

[Expect]
Bot2.Battlefield.Ancient Crab.Damage = 4
Bot1.Graveyard = Unsubtle Mockery; Mountain; Black Lotus
